		"name": "WhatsApp Workflow Automation API - v1",
		"description": "API documentation for the WhatsApp Workflow Automation project. This collection is intended for Flutter mobile developers to integrate authentication and core features.\n\n### Authentication\nThe API uses Laravel Sanctum for bearer token authentication. Use the **Auth > Login** request to obtain a token, which will be automatically saved to the `auth_token` environment variable.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
